{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55972","headline":"游般若寺上方 · 廖处士","name":"游般若寺上方","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"榔粟步溪光，随云到上方。\n经秋禅客病，积雨石楼荒。\n古藓糜鹿迹，阴崖松桧香。\n平生豁所思，吟啸倚苍苍。\n（见《吟窗杂录》卷十三桂林淳大师《诗评》引）（按：此诗署廖处士作，当爲廖匡图、廖凝、廖融等人中之一人。\n未审孰是，姑仍分列。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"廖处士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55972.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55972","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}